  "description": "This META SX V5 SIGNATURE comes equipped with a top-tier build. Every component is selected for its performance and to bring out the full potential of the frame.\n• With the 38 Float Factory fork we offer the best from FOX: rigid chassis, Kashima anti-friction stanchions and Grip 2 cartridge with hydraulic adjustments. On the back, the Float X2 Factory is adapted to the kinematics of the frame. High and low speed compression and rebound adjustments play on the air volume and can be adjusted to rider style and the terrain. It has an external lock-out lever.\n• SHIMANO Deore XT 4-piston brakes with 203mm discs offer a clear feel and proven reliability.\n• DT SWISS EX 1700 aluminium wheels are hand-assembled and feature an ultra-strong welded rim.\n• The SHIMANO Deore XT 12-speed group is efficient and allows quick and smooth gear changing.",
